      "created_at": "2016-04-11T12:42:04Z",
      "updated_at": "2016-04-11T12:42:04Z",
      "body": "Monal doesn't display images online. This is at the moment an intentional design decision. I'll add an option to have inline display in the future but it will be opt in only. Inline display exposes your IP address (and therefore your location)  to the sender and has serious privacy issues. \n",
      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
